  "title": "Jurisdiction In-Context Learning (J-ICL)",
  "summary": "Jurisdiction In-Context Learning (J-ICL) improves the reliability of In-Context Learning (ICL) by incorporating context validation into the training objective, addressing the trade-off between ICL capability and resistance to misleading context. This framework enhances ICL performance and reality accuracy across multiple benchmarks.",
